<Base title="Who We Build For" description="Charging networks, program managers, fleets, developers, BESS and public agencies: one self-performing California C-10 / Class A contractor." path="/who-we-serve/">
<section id="who"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Who we build for</p>
    <h1>Built for the people who have to hit the energization date.</h1>
    <p class="lead">We work as a direct prime or as the self-perform sub under your program. Either way you get one crew, one schedule and one point of contact from mobilization to closeout.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="buyers">
    <div class="buyer"><h3>Charging networks</h3><p>Repeatable site delivery for DCFC and Supercharger programs.</p>
      <ul><li>Tesla V3/V4, EA and EVgo standards</li><li>Multi-site crews running in parallel</li><li>Closeout packages that pass the first time</li></ul></div>
    <div class="buyer"><h3>Program managers and EPCs</h3><p>A Tier 1 self-perform partner that carries its own scope.</p>
      <ul><li>Civil and electrical under one subcontract</li><li>Daily reports, JSAs and utility avoidance plans</li><li>Change orders documented, not argued</li></ul></div>
    <div class="buyer"><h3>Fleet and heavy-duty</h3><p>Depot and truck charging where power and civil scope are large.</p>
      <ul><li>Megacharger and MCS experience</li><li>Large duct banks, vaults and switchgear pads</li><li>Phased work around live operations</li></ul></div>
    <div class="buyer"><h3>Developers and property owners</h3><p>Charging and power upgrades that open on time.</p>
      <ul><li>Constructability and budget pricing early</li><li>Utility application support and coordination</li><li>ADA, paving and site restoration included</li></ul></div>
    <div class="buyer"><h3>Battery storage</h3><p>BESS integration on commercial and utility sites.</p>
      <ul><li>40+ BESS sites delivered statewide</li><li>Excavation, underground and concrete pads</li><li>Equipment sets, crane picks and conduit</li><li>Metering and disconnect assemblies</li></ul></div>
    <div class="buyer"><h3>Public agencies and utilities</h3><p>Prevailing wage work done right the first time.</p>
      <ul><li>DIR-registered, certified payroll</li><li>Correct trade classifications</li><li>SCE, SDG&amp;E, PG&amp;E, LADWP, BWP, SMUD</li></ul></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
